          The [OCID](/iaas/Content/General/Concepts/identifiers.htm) of the VWAN connection.
        maxLength: 255
        minLength: 1
        type: string
      compartmentId:
        description: |
          The [OCID](/iaas/Content/General/Concepts/identifiers.htm) of the compartment that contains the
          resource connection.
        maxLength: 255
        minLength: 1
        type: string
      displayName: *ref-displayName
      connectedResourceId:
        description: |
          The [OCID](/iaas/Content/General/Concepts/identifiers.htm) of the resource connected to the VWAN.
        maxLength: 255
        minLength: 1
        type: string
      connectedResourceDisplayName:
        description: |
          The display name of the resource connected to the VWAN. Avoid entering confidential information.
        maxLength: 255
        minLength: 1
        type: string
      connectedResourceType:
        description: |
          The type of resource connected to the VWAN.
        enum:
          - DRG
        type: string
      connectedResourceRegion:
        description: |
          The region that the connected resource is in.

          Example: `us-phoenix-1`
        maxLength: 255
        minLength: 1
        type: string
      virtualWanId:
        description: |
          The [OCID](/iaas/Content/General/Concepts/identifiers.htm) of the VWAN.
        maxLength: 255
        minLength: 1
        type: string
      timeCreated:
        description: |
          The date and time the VWAN connection was created, in the format
          defined by [RFC3339](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3339).

          Example: `2016-08-25T21:10:29.600Z`
